(6284413, 928418, 69325, '<td valign="top">ahhhh, this reminds me of the days when I was a CIA operative stationed in Kerala running the South India safe house. During what little downtime I had I would go to the beach and watch the fishermen while I sipped turkish coffee prepared for me by my houseboy Hadji. When I wasn''t being shot at, it was a beautiful time in my life.</td>', 'ahhhh, this reminds me of the days when I was a CIA operative stationed in Kerala running the South India safe house. During what little downtime I had I would go to the beach and watch the fishermen while I sipped turkish coffee prepared for me by my houseboy Hadji. When I wasn''t being shot at, it was a beautiful time in my life.', '2011-01-16 09:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6284422, 929344, 69325, '<td valign="top">i dunno.....i;m not a carpenter, but the tools in the hand feel almost random, or maybe just that the pliers shouldn''t be there, i do however love your processing with the subued colors</td>', 'i dunno.....i;m not a carpenter, but the tools in the hand feel almost random, or maybe just that the pliers shouldn''t be there, i do however love your processing with the subued colors', '2011-01-16 09:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
