(6284760, 929627, 98022, '<td valign="top">At first glance, nothing about this photo says work to me. But I tend to take things much too literal at times. Upon further consideration, several thoughts come to mind. If you consider who might use a manlift to get into position for bird watching, then it comes to mind that this might be these peoples jobs, maybe some type of research. Or maybe it represents the amount of work that it would take to set up and employ a manlift for bird watching.<br/> <br/>But if I consider the overall moodiness of the photo, with the mostly dark brooding sky along with the dark figures in the manlift, I get another representation. To me, the bird seems to be flying away from the figures towards the light area of the sky. Perhaps the bird represents the work and effort that it takes to reach a higher plane of existance, or perhaps heaven, from the sometimes darkness of our life here on earth. That would be truly worthwhile work.<br/> <br/>A thought provoking image.</td>', 'At first glance, nothing about this photo says work to me. But I tend to take things much too literal at times. Upon further consideration, several thoughts come to mind. If you consider who might use a manlift to get into position for bird watching, then it comes to mind that this might be these peoples jobs, maybe some type of research. Or maybe it represents the amount of work that it would take to set up and employ a manlift for bird watching. But if I consider the overall moodiness of the photo, with the mostly dark brooding sky along with the dark figures in the manlift, I get another representation. To me, the bird seems to be flying away from the figures towards the light area of the sky. Perhaps the bird represents the work and effort that it takes to reach a higher plane of existance, or perhaps heaven, from the sometimes darkness of our life here on earth. That would be truly worthwhile work. A thought provoking image.', '2011-01-16 15:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6284761, 929611, 98022, '<td valign="top">I really like the Topaz-like effect here. Great leading line with the road.</td>', 'I really like the Topaz-like effect here. Great leading line with the road.', '2011-01-16 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
