(6285184, 929432, 120989, '<td valign="top">Good idea for demonstrating simple mechanics.<br/> <br/>lol: Math is incorrect. <br/>F is along the pull, so W = F * d.<br/>Theta ~ pi/2 =&gt; cos(th) ~ 0 =&gt; W ~ 0. <br/>I guess you wanted to show horizontal pull.</td>', 'Good idea for demonstrating simple mechanics. lol: Math is incorrect. F is along the pull, so W = F * d.Theta ~ pi/2 => cos(th) ~ 0 => W ~ 0. I guess you wanted to show horizontal pull.', '2011-01-16 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
