(6288237, 929214, 115814, '<td valign="top">Thanks, everyone, for the congrats and nice comments. I thought this was a pretty decent shot when I submitted, but getting a new personal best score and the ribbon was a pleasant surprise!<br/> <br/>This photo was taken in a working/teaching blacksmith guild shop that''s part of my city''s historical preservation program. They wanted to purchase property that the original shop was on, so agreed to move the business to the city park and to support the guild''s education program.</td>', 'Thanks, everyone, for the congrats and nice comments. I thought this was a pretty decent shot when I submitted, but getting a new personal best score and the ribbon was a pleasant surprise! This photo was taken in a working/teaching blacksmith guild shop that''s part of my city''s historical preservation program. They wanted to purchase property that the original shop was on, so agreed to move the business to the city park and to support the guild''s education program.', '2011-01-19 11:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6288243, 928703, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2011-01-19 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
