(6296335, 929357, 3936, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8 on this one, because I am aware of the technical difficulty in getting this image.  I thought that while not the traditional eye candy DPC loves, flying the space station is more work than most people realize, and getting this image was quite a bit of work and planning in and of itself.  4.1 is much too low for this image.  You was robbed!</td>', 'I gave you an 8 on this one, because I am aware of the technical difficulty in getting this image.  I thought that while not the traditional eye candy DPC loves, flying the space station is more work than most people realize, and getting this image was quite a bit of work and planning in and of itself.  4.1 is much too low for this image.  You was robbed!', '2011-01-28 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
